#format i3, i5
9
  1  150
  2  100
  3  150
  4   25
  5   75
  6  100
  7  100
  8  100
  9  100
 10  100

This file tells make_eep how many secondary EEP intervals there are
(1st line) and how many secondary EEPs to place in each interval.
The number between each pair of primaries is specified on a line
as

XXXYYYYY

3 digits to specify secondary EEP interval and 5 to specify the number
of secondary EEPs to place in that interval.

For N=10 primary EEPs there will be N-1=9 secondary intervals.
